.agent/active/scoring/v1_3_k_score_round3_codex.out:6362:The local toolchain confirms the sandbox limitation: `cargo +nightly` cannot update under `~/.rustup`, and `cargo fuzz` is not installed. I started the stable `cargo check` for the fuzz manifest because it is still useful syntax/build evidence without requiring the GH fuzz runner.
.agent/active/scoring/v1_3_k_score_round3_codex.out:6366:/bin/bash -lc 'CARGO_HOME=/private/tmp/rev_scoring_cargo_home CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/private/tmp/rev_scoring_fuzz_target cargo check --manifest-path crates/stealth-sanitize/fuzz/Cargo.toml --bins' in $REPO_ROOT
.agent/active/scoring/v1_3_k_score_round3_codex.out:6873:With Cargo redirected to `/private/tmp`, the fuzz manifest and all three fuzz bins compile under stable `cargo check --bins`. That is not a substitute for the nightly `cargo fuzz run` cron, but it resolves the local “target does not compile” concern.
