.agent/active/reviews/p5_2_review_retry.log:3646:.agent/active/v1_1_p6_linux_baseline.md:57:3. **D-Bus / Secret Service absence in headless containers**: confirmed — the `keyring` crate's `Entry::new` returns `Err` when no D-Bus session bus is reachable. The `stealth-auth` crate already has the `passphrase-only` Cargo feature (`crates/stealth-auth/Cargo.toml` line 17) plus the `KeySource::Passphrase` variant that derives an Argon2id key from `REV_SCRAPING_AUTH_PASSPHRASE`. P6 verified the feature compiles and `ensure_keyring_available()` correctly returns `KeyringUnavailable` under that feature. Recommend documenting this in README §14 follow-up.
