.agent/active/reviews/p13_4_review_round2.out:110:I’m using the `staff-code-reviewer` skill for this review because this is an explicit BLOCK/LGTM gate. I’ll verify the claimed closures against the actual diff and run targeted checks where they matter.
.agent/active/reviews/p13_4_review_round2.out:2046:- Do not issue LGTM unless the Revharness reviewer contract is satisfied.
